    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d211-a1">

                <pb facs="0363" n="1827" sameAs="frus:frus1951v06p2/pg1827"/>

                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Annex]</seg>
                </opener>
                <p rendition="#flush">
                    <hi rendition="#small-caps">secret</hi>
                </p>
                <p rendition="#flush">
                    WFM B–2/3<hi rendition="#italic">b</hi>
                </p>
                <p rendition="#flush">(Supplement)</p>
                <p rendition="#flush">
                    <hi rendition="#small-caps">Views of the Embassy in London on Probable British
                        Attitudes on Subjects To Be Discussed in the Washington Foreign Ministers’
                        Meetings</hi>
                </p>
                <p rendition="#center">
                    <hi rendition="#small-caps">kashmir</hi>
                </p>
                <p>The Foreign Office regards the situation as extremely dangerous, and Morrison
                    will probably propose that we endeavor to get the Security Council to refer the
                    matter to the Assembly thus putting the matter into a wider forum where the veto
                    does not apply.</p>
            </div>
        </body>
